Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.65,0:00:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.69,0:00:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So tell me, gentlemen, what do\Nyou think of my newest soldiers?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.11,0:00:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there's no need\Nfor any introductions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.47,0:00:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.41,0:00:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just drop the magic act and let's duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.07,0:00:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But we are dueling, you insensible twit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.13,0:00:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just doing it by\Nmy rules, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.17,0:00:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I now control the\Nsouls of your former friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.21,0:00:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it would be fun to\Nlet them play along with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.67,0:00:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.09,0:00:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This ends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.65,0:00:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How right you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.73,0:00:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just about done once I play this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.63,0:00:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,For the seal of Orichalcos is\Nabout to become even stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.95,0:00:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you up to, darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.89,0:00:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, it's time to experience\Nthe third level of darkness. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.39,0:00:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Orichalcos Tritos!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.63,0:02:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to reinforce the Sacred Seal\Nwith its most powerful layer thus far.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.79,0:02:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold the ancient magic\Nof my Orichalcos Tritos!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.23,0:02:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to level three, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.07,0:02:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How can the seal possibly\Nget any stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.91,0:02:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We're dealing with a force\Ngreater than the darkest shadows,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.25,0:02:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and older than time itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.99,0:02:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that answer your question?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.97,0:02:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.11,0:02:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,His life points are out of control!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.41,0:02:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ori, Kalkos, Malevolence!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.95,0:02:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Use your special ability to switch\NKaiba's dragon into attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.77,0:02:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm afraid this is goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.31,0:02:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,With an attack strength of only 1,400,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.89,0:02:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,your dragon is far too weak\Nto defend your lifeblocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.07,0:02:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So that means you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.09,0:02:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my beast, bring Kaiba's soul to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.17,0:02:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Raw, I activate my shrink card.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.35,0:03:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it beginning to sink in yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.65,0:03:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,When used properly,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.93,0:03:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,the seal of Aurichalcos is unmatched\Nby any other card in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.99,0:03:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And due to its third layer, your magic\Nand trap cards are useless against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.13,0:03:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Darts is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.27,0:03:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Each layer of the seal is\Nmore powerful than the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.97,0:03:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't think of something soon,\NKaiba's going to lose the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.71,0:03:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And worse, his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.89,0:03:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,As I was saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.65,0:03:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Aura is Malevolent!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.79,0:03:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy Kaiba's dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.87,0:03:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.05,0:03:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.29,0:03:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I play my Apple Shield card!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.61,0:03:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This allows me to sacrifice\NBig Shield Gardener!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.09,0:03:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I can transfer every\None of its defense points
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.65,0:03:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,to Different Dimension\NDragon's attack points!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.41,0:03:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh sacrificed his\Nown monster to save Kaiba's!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.51,0:03:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, rich boy owes him big time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.97,0:03:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Different Dimension Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.59,0:03:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Counter-attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.50,0:03:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush his monster, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.01,0:04:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,All the damage is absorbed by my Qtora!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.47,0:04:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how powerful our monsters are,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.41,0:04:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,his life points are safe as long\Nas his Qtora's on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.79,0:04:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,is your dueling partner\Nreally worth that much
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.63,0:04:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,to you pharaoh because\Nyou just gave up your only
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.65,0:04:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,defense to save him leaving\Nyour life points wide
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.45,0:04:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,open to a direct attack as\Na matter of fact you left
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.05,0:04:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,yourself open to four attacks\Nand i have the perfect
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.79,0:04:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Foursome in mind for the\Njob, my Mirror Knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.17,0:04:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,known affectionately to\Nyou as my pegasus yugi and
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.57,0:04:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,joey now strike down the\Npharaoh my poor knights
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.75,0:05:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,how's it feel they're on my side now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.71,0:05:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,one more left i save the best for last
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.65,0:05:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi boy, please tell me you\Nhave the card I gave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.21,0:05:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're our only hope, so I've created an\Nexclusive card just for you, Yugi boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.09,0:05:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No, real special card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.73,0:05:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing's completely blank, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.31,0:05:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.93,0:05:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Not necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.73,0:05:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That card unlocks the secret\Nof the legendary dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.37,0:05:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for? Attack him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.11,0:05:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.11,0:05:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.77,0:05:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.95,0:05:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.17,0:05:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.25,0:06:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Our life points are decreasing, while\Ndarts continues to grow stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.21,0:06:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, what did Pegasus mean by unlocking\Nthe secret of the legendary dragons?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.87,0:06:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Could the card he gave me be\Nthe secret to defeating darts?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.37,0:06:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And saving mankind?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.71,0:06:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll place one card face\Ndown and end my turn for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.69,0:06:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Kyber.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.09,0:06:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and make your final move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.33,0:06:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,For with only 600 points left,\Nyour time is just about up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.41,0:06:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to admit it, but if I don't think\Nof something quick, Darts is gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.19,0:06:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can't let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.57,0:06:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Not after everything that\Nlunatic's put me through.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.05,0:06:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never see my brother again, because\Nyour father took him away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.85,0:06:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, what Alistair doesn't know is\Nthat Kaiba's father didn't do a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.05,0:06:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That honor belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.61,0:07:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Convincing Alistair that my family\Nruined his life was one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.51,0:07:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But when Darts bought out my\Ncompany, he crossed the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.05,0:07:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's no way I'm letting\Nhim get away with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.31,0:07:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have pushed around\Nyour little cronies,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.13,0:07:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,but I refuse to end up like they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.97,0:07:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So I play this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.19,0:07:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I should have warned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.31,0:07:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever I'm about to lose,\NI draw exactly what I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.63,0:07:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And this time's no different.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.33,0:07:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Critias!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.91,0:07:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if I know your gaming\Nstrategies as well as I think I do,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.29,0:07:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'd have to say the face-down card you\Nplayed before is your Mirror Force Trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.87,0:07:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.85,0:07:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I reveal Yugi's Trap card!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.81,0:08:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, I'll merge the Fang\Nof Critias with Mirror Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.11,0:08:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.93,0:08:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirror Force Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.79,0:08:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you plan to attack? Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.67,0:08:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,you know as well as I do\Nthat there's no way we can
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.15,0:08:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,win as long as he's got those\Nfour knights on the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.33,0:08:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.41,0:08:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just monster\Nholograms, so get over it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.65,0:08:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Darts made him look like your lame\Nfriend, so you'd be afraid to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.11,0:08:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.91,0:08:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirror Force Dragon, attack\Nhis Pegasus Knight now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.95,0:08:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.03,0:08:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would Kaiba attack\Nthe one that had a shield?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.31,0:08:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, Zeta wanted that knight\Nto reflect his attack, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.87,0:09:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the long face?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.95,0:09:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be you're aware of\Nmy dragon's special ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.63,0:09:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Go absorb reflection!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.27,0:09:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Kaiba knew what he was doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.87,0:09:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.07,0:09:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother's always got a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.21,0:09:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to use the power I just\Nabsorbed by reflecting the blast
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.81,0:09:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,back to your side and taking out\Nall four of your knights. So do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.85,0:09:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, if they get hit,\Nare their souls lost forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.63,0:09:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We're about to find out. Don't think I'm\Nas gullible as the rest of these dorks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.25,0:09:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't scare me with a couple of\Nreprogrammed holograms Don't you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.03,0:09:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I invented this technology And\NI know how you manipulated the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.17,0:09:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,images to resemble those four\Nlosers So you can drop the act darts
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.63,0:09:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirror Force Dragon,\Nflatten those phonies now
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.15,0:10:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Absorb Reflection!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.63,0:10:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.77,0:10:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.07,0:10:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.98,0:10:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.07,0:10:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We're fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.69,0:10:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.33,0:10:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kaiba boy, you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.01,0:10:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.81,0:10:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Very impressive, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.01,0:10:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.15,0:10:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, my life points\Nare still unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.11,0:10:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, even though it's\Nabout to be destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.97,0:10:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,my Qtora is able to absorb all the\Ndamage before saying its final goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.99,0:10:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,At least my friends are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.81,0:10:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my dragon, you have\Nno monsters to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.75,0:10:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I beg to differ.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.97,0:11:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a closer look, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.67,0:11:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Eutora has another ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.35,0:11:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever it's destroyed, it evolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.17,0:11:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.81,0:11:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.27,0:11:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.85,0:11:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My little friend is all\Ngrown up, so playtime's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.05,0:11:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, I'd like you to\Nmeet Ori Calco Shunaros.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.65,0:11:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You see what I see? Unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.83,0:11:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,See what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.77,0:11:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing's got 20,000 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.97,0:11:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look so surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.23,0:11:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the ones who created\Nthis unstoppable beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.21,0:12:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have destroyed my previous monsters,\Nbut you unleashed something far worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.81,0:12:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It can wipe us out in one strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.25,0:12:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right, but before I do\Nthat, I have some more bad news to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.49,0:12:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Orichalcos Shunaros, activate\Nyour special ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.95,0:12:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Release Orichalcos Dexia!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.77,0:12:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And Orichalcos Anisteros!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.69,0:12:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.11,0:12:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to clear things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.57,0:12:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Shunaros just released two more creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.05,0:12:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The first one is known as Dexia,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.99,0:12:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and its attack strength is always 300 points\Nhigher than the monster it's battling,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.29,0:12:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,making it the perfect sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.95,0:12:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And the second one is just as strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.75,0:12:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It will intercept every one\Nof your attacks and retaliate
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.79,0:12:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,with a blast that's 300 points\Ngreater than the one you fired,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.05,0:12:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,making Orycalcos Aristeros\Nthe perfect shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.39,0:12:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never get past my triple threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.23,0:13:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only is his monster more\Npowerful than Kaiba's dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.81,0:13:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,but with Dexia and Aristeros on the front\Nline, our attacks won't even get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.59,0:13:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate the trap card Martyr Curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.63,0:13:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This force is one of your monsters to\Nengage in a battle with one of my monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.75,0:13:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And as a nasty little side effect,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.69,0:13:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,it cancels out any special\Nabilities your creature may have.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.13,0:13:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And since I don't seem\Nto have much of a choice,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.21,0:13:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll target your Mirror Force Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.17,0:13:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Without its reflecting power, your\Ndragon's completely defenseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.49,0:13:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means you're about\Nto be out-won souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.59,0:13:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Orichalcosuneros!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.69,0:13:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Remove Kyber's life points so the\NOrichalcos can remove his spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.17,0:13:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Photon ring blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.19,0:13:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ta-ta, Kyber!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.29,0:14:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't keep the great Leviathan waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.29,0:14:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyber, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.81,0:14:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Or I Kalkos 1, Seto Kaiba, zip.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.05,0:14:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.01,0:14:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, are you all right? Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.25,0:14:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.37,0:14:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate! Trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.57,0:14:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called Wish, a final effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.29,0:14:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It converts every one of my dragon's\Nattack points into your life points, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.11,0:14:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.41,0:14:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.49,0:14:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Echo, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.23,0:14:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.31,0:14:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.61,0:14:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't screw up. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.05,0:15:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I fought too hard, so you\Ncan't lose this. Now win!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.55,0:15:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.09,0:15:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.97,0:15:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Farrow, it looks like\Nyou're the sole survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.13,0:15:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You disgust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.01,0:15:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.73,0:15:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I already have what I need,\Nyou can keep the rest of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.79,0:15:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.79,0:15:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.49,0:15:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.01,0:15:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Please open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.87,0:15:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're in there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.35,0:15:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,On the contrary, my young friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.59,0:15:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're talking\Nto an empty shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.09,0:15:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother has graciously donated\Nhis life force to the Great Beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.83,0:15:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not Pear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.23,0:15:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him back, darts!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.91,0:16:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.97,0:16:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear that? Thanks to Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.51,0:16:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's generous donation, the\Ngreat Leviathan is almost ready. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.27,0:16:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell your stupid lizard to spit out\Nmy brother before I force him to!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.27,0:16:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.99,0:16:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.97,0:16:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.15,0:16:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tea? Tristan? Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.59,0:16:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Pharaoh, you're all alone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.33,0:17:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.91,0:17:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friends are fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.05,0:17:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need weak souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.93,0:17:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to spend some\Nquality time with you one-on-one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.51,0:17:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.01,0:17:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.31,0:17:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's something I\Nthink you'll want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.17,0:17:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I met 5,000 years ago\Nwhen you were king of Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.01,0:17:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We may not have been officially introduced,\Nbut I was there watching you. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.39,0:17:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,When the Battle of Atlantis ended, I thought\Nthe Great Leviathan was gone forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.95,0:17:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That is, until I met you. Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.99,0:17:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that evil creature\Nof yours have to do with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.89,0:17:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd never ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.43,0:17:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold the palace of the\Npharaoh in the year 3000 BC
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.05,0:17:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ring any bells?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.55,0:18:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, is that really\Nme in the ancient past?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.53,0:18:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to vanquish this intruder,\Nmy king No, I shall handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.61,0:18:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Great deity of darkness, I invoke thee.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.63,0:18:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.67,0:18:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Arise, Obelisk the Tormentor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.31,0:18:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The great power of the\Nshadows is in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.29,0:18:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk, subdue this intruder\Nwith your fist of fury!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.85,0:18:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are we watching this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.87,0:18:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it was on this\Nvery day that I first
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.59,0:18:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,realized the great\NLeviathan would rise again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.53,0:18:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's all because of you\Nand the magic that you wield.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.89,0:18:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Atlantis was destroyed\Nand Leviathan was laid to rest,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.69,0:19:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I was forced to wander the earth and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.31,0:19:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I couldn't wipe\Nout mankind on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.51,0:19:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I needed power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.73,0:19:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where you came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.65,0:19:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,See for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.53,0:19:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I sensed it immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.71,0:19:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life energy was\Nexactly what I needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.15,0:19:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But the time wasn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.21,0:19:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So my wait continues. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.25,0:19:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If you needed my power, then why\Ndidn't you confront me back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.25,0:19:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Because there was another individual\Nthreatening to destroy the planet,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.77,0:19:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and quite frankly, he was in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.99,0:19:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But I knew my day would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.95,0:19:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.65,0:19:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Five thousand years later, when a naive\Nyoung man unlocked the dark magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.75,0:20:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,With that came the return\Nof the Shadow Games.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.73,0:20:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And the rebirth of the\Npharaohs and his rivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.67,0:20:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's why you've been targeting\Nmy friends. That's right, you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.07,0:20:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,be flattered never before have i\Nencountered such a powerful group of
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.85,0:20:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,souls you're sick oh i'm the sick\None the fact remains that you ushered
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.53,0:20:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,in the age of the shadow games five\Nthousand years ago and nearly wiped
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.95,0:20:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,out your whole kingdom that's a lie\Ni saw it all the way you conjured
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.67,0:20:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,up creatures of darkness to do your\Nbidding your evil Pharaoh and there's
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.05,0:20:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,no denying it and soon you'll get\Nwhat you deserve when I feed your soul
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.37,0:20:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,to the great Leviathan and complete\Nthat which I started centuries ago
